==English==

===Alternative forms===
* {{l|en|righthand}}

===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|ryghte-hande}}, from {{inh|en|ang|rihthand||right-hand}}, equivalent to {{compound|en|right|hand}}.

===Adjective===
{{head|en|adjective|head=[[right]]-[[hand]]}}

# of, relating to, or located on the right
# designed for use by the right hand
# in the direction or orientation to the [[right-hand rule]] (a right-hand [[screw thread|thread]])

